h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 703)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Set up personal links before you share.</b> Personal links now show in the Shared Review panel before a web share is started, not only after. Add the people beforehand &#8212; they get their links the moment the share is up &#8212; and tick &#8220;Only people I invite can join&#8221; in advance.</li>
<li><b>Email a link.</b> Add an address after a name if you like (Scott Tinter scott@studio.com) and the row&#8217;s Email button drafts a message to them in your own mail app, for you to read and send. Asobi sends nothing itself, the address never leaves your Mac, and the passphrase is never in the draft.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
